ve Incident' activity with the attribute 'Resolution Time'.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Verify Resolution\",\"description\":\"The 'Verify Resolution' activity involves verifying that the incident has been properly resolved.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"name\":\"Verification Result\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Verification Result: Successful, Failed' indicates whether the resolution verification was successful or failed.\",\"min_value\":null,\"max_value\":null,\"enumeration_values\":[\"Successful\",\"Failed\"]}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Verify Resolution: Verification Result' links the 'Verify Resolution' activity with the attribute 'Verification Result'.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Close Incident\",\"description\":\"The 'Close Incident' activity involves closing the incident after resolution and verification.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"name\":\"Status\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Status: New, In Progress, Resolved, Closed' indicates the current status of the incident.\",\"min_value\":null,\"max_value\":null,\"enumeration_values\":[\"New\",\"In Progress\",\"Resolved\",\"Closed\"]}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Close Incident: Status' specifies that the activity 'Close Incident' requires the attribute 'Status'.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Escalate Incident\",\"description\":\"The 'Escalate Incident' activity involves escalating the incident to a higher level of authority.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"name\":\"Escalation Level\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Escalation Level: None, Level 1, Level 2, Level 3' specifies the escalation level of the incident.\",\"min_value\":null,\"max_value\":null,\"enumeration_values\":[\"None\",\"Level 1\",\"Level 2\",\"Level 3\"]}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Escalate Incident: Escalation Level' links the 'Escalate Incident' activity with the attribute 'Escalation Level'.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Document Incident\",\"description\":\"The 'Document Incident' activity involves documenting all details related to the incident.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"integer\",\"name\":\"Document ID\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Document ID: integer between 1000 and 9999' represents the unique identifier for the incident documentation.\",\"min_value\":1000,\"max_value\":9999,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Document Incident: Document ID' links the 'Document Incident' activity with the attribute 'Document ID'.\"}],\"constraints\":[{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Report Incident' must be the first activity to occur in the process.\",\"template\":\"Init\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Report Incident\",\"description\":\"The 'Report Incident' activity involves reporting an incident that has occurred.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Close Incident' must be the last activity to occur in the process.\",\"template\":\"End\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Close Incident\",\"description\":\"The 'Close Incident' activity involves closing the incident after resolution and verification.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Report Incident' activity occurs, then an 'Assess Impact' activity must eventually occur after the 'Report Incident' event at some point in the same process instance, within 0 to 24 hours. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Report Incident' can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Assess Impact' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Report Incident'. If 'Report Incident' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Assess Impact'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Report Incident\",\"description\":\"The 'Report Incident' activity involves reporting an incident that has occurred.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Assess Impact\",\"description\":\"The 'Assess Impact' activity involves evaluating the impact of the reported incident.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,24,h\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"An 'Assess Impact' activity must be followed by a 'Prioritize Incident' activity at some point later in the same process instance. Conversely, a 'Prioritize Incident' event can occur only if an 'Assess Impact' event has occurred before it within the same process instance. This bidirectional and ordered dependency ensures that 'Assess Impact' impose obligations for future 'Prioritize Incident', and 'Prioritize Incident' cannot occur without prior 'Assess Impact'. Multiple 'Assess Impact' and 'Prioritize Incident' are allowed, with each 'Assess Impact' eventually leading to a 'Prioritize Incident' and each 'Prioritize Incident' being justified by a preceding 'Assess Impact'.\",\"template\":\"Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Assess Impact\",\"description\":\"The 'Assess Impact' activity involves evaluating the impact of the reported incident.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Prioritize Incident\",\"description\":\"The 'Prioritize Incident' activity involves determining the priority level of the incident.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Prioritize Incident' activity is permitted to occur only if an 'Assign Incident' activity has occurred before it within the same process instance, and only when the 'Priority' attribute of the 'Prioritize Incident' activity is either 'High' or 'Critical'. 'Prioritize Incident' events that occur without any prior 'Assign Incident' are violations of the constraint. Multiple 'Assign Incident' can occur, and any number of events (including other 'Prioritize Incident') can happen between an 'Assign Incident' and a subsequent 'Prioritize Incident'. This ensures that certain actions cannot proceed without the necessary prerequisites being met first.\",\"template\":\"Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Prioritize Incident\",\"description\":\"The 'Prioritize Incident' activity involves determining the priority level of the incident.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Assign Incident\",\"description\":\"The 'Assign Incident' activity involves assigning the incident to a specific team for handling.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":\"T.Priority in (High, Critical)\",\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Investigate Incident' activity is permitted to occur only if a 'Resolve Incident' activity has occurred before it within the same process instance. 'Investigate Incident' events that occur without any prior 'Resolve Incident' are violations of the constraint. Multiple 'Resolve Incident' can occur, and any number of events (including other 'Investigate Incident') can happen between a 'Resolve Incident' and a subsequent 'Investigate Incident'. This ensures that certain actions cannot proceed without the necessary prerequisites being met first.\",\"template\":\"Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Investigate Incident\",\"description\":\"The 'Investigate Incident' activity involves conducting an investigation into the incident.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Resolve Incident\",\"description\":\"The 'Resolve Incident' activity involves resolving the incident.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Resolve Incident' activity occurs, then a 'Verify Resolution' activity must eventually occur after the 'Resolve Incident' event at some point in the same process instance, within 0 to 48 hours. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in b